WEBVTT

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:11.310
<i>The fire burned the housing complex's 
twenty-square-meter third floor,</i>

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:13.140
<i>but no one was injured.</i>

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:17.300
<i>Currently, the fire department is 
investigating the fire's cause.</i>

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:19.120
<b>Tokyo</b>

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>That concludes the news for this hour.</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:22.200
<i>Next, the traffic report—</i>

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:25.960
<i>So, today, from the new drama 
that premieres tonight—</i>

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:27.970
<i>...about an unusual dog.</i>

00:00:27.970 --> 00:00:31.270
<i>This is Pan-kun, and he lives 
in America, in Wisconsin!</i>

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:35.140
<i>He can pull things much 
heavier than his own body.</i>

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:35.880
<i>Nope, it isn't on TV anywhere.</i>

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:53.360
Hi, this is Sanae.

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:54.820
I'm on my way home.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:57.300
Huh?

00:00:58.270 --> 00:00:59.900
Sana-chan?

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:55.020
<b>Dreams of Alice</b>

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:03.780
<b>Sanae         |     Grandpa</b>

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:03.780
<b>

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:03.780
<b>

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:03.780
<b>

00:03:05.430 --> 00:03:07.620
I'm home...

00:03:31.070 --> 00:03:33.820
What a pretty little girl.

00:03:40.890 --> 00:03:42.580
Huh? Huh?

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:44.700
What're you making?

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:48.540
They're graves.

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:54.030
Whose graves?

00:03:57.370 --> 00:03:59.500
This one's for the bug.

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:01.980
This one's for the goldfish.

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:05.800
And these are for Mommy and Daddy.

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:09.810
<i>Is that Grandpa and me?</i>

00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:24.530
Who are you?

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:25.710
You're flying!

00:04:25.710 --> 00:04:27.280
Wow!

00:04:28.390 --> 00:04:31.900
You really do have a mysterious 
power, don't you?

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:37.380
You know, Grandpa asked me 
to make you some food.

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:42.640
Oh, I'm Kashimura Zoroku's 
granddaughter, Sanae.

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:44.170
Nice to meet you.

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:46.720
Zo... Granddaughter? Food?

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:48.600
That's right.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:55.680
I've come here to give you a 
delicious meal and snacks...

00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:58.760
Because I'm a food alien!

00:04:58.760 --> 00:05:00.440
Pose!

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:04.520
Just kidding.

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:05.580
Wha... F-Foo...

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:06.960
What? Huh?

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:09.260
Uh, no, I didn't mean it!

00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:11.120
I'm sorry.

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:16.030
So your name's Sana-chan, huh?

00:05:16.030 --> 00:05:18.410
My grandpa told me about you.

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:21.130
He said you lived in a really scary place

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:23.730
and went through some awful things.

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:27.380
It's okay if you're scared of me, too.

00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:30.120
But if you're hungry,

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:33.210
you should come down, 
even if it's not right away.

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:41.820
Oink, oink.

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:44.530
I'm not a mean pig, oink.

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:47.100
I'm a food alien, oink!

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:51.950
What are these? Pigs?

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:53.350
Hey...

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:55.560
No! Stop!

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:56.710
You're weird.

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:57.870
Darn...

00:05:58.210 --> 00:05:59.770
Gotcha!

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:03.850
Now we're buried in pigs 
together! Take that!

00:06:03.850 --> 00:06:05.250
S-Stop that!

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.890
I'm not stopping. Take that.

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:07.000
No!

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:23.820
Anyway, where did these 
little guys come from?

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:37.190
The heck is this?

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:40.650
Hello?

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:43.110
<i>Hello, Grandpa?</i>

00:06:43.110 --> 00:06:44.130
<i>Did you see my message?</i>

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:47.170
That's right! They're pigs!

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:50.650
It's true, you know. They're live pigs.

00:06:48.690 --> 00:06:49.840
No!

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:52.510
Don't come out! Stay in there!

00:06:50.650 --> 00:06:54.350
She is strange, just like you said.

00:06:53.380 --> 00:06:54.350
I said no!

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:56.910
<i>I mean, these are pigs... Pigs!</i>

00:06:56.910 --> 00:06:58.550
She did something again?

00:06:56.910 --> 00:07:00.480
And you stay in there, too! 
I said to stay!

00:06:58.550 --> 00:07:00.480
<i>No, it wasn't her fault.</i>

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:03.940
I just scared her a little. That's all.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:06.530
Stop! Stop!

00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:06.530
<i>What was that? Did something happen?</i>

00:07:07.430 --> 00:07:08.740
That tickles!

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:10.750
No, everything is fine.

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:11.450
Stop it!

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:14.320
Yep, I think she's warmed 
up to me a little.

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:17.040
Stop!

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:17.040
She's so cute.

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:18.340
Okay, then.

00:07:18.340 --> 00:07:21.010
Call me if anything comes up. Bye.

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:23.420
Was that Sanae-chan?

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:24.000
Yeah.

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:26.280
Did something happen?

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:28.730
Nah, nothing important.

00:07:28.730 --> 00:07:30.150
It's been a while.

00:07:30.150 --> 00:07:32.460
Why don't you go home early today?

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:35.760
<b>Naito Ryu</b>

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:39.200
Yeah, it's me.

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:40.620
Been a long time.

00:07:41.220 --> 00:07:44.230
Actually, I have a favor to ask.

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:49.300
Was he mad?

00:07:49.930 --> 00:07:51.220
It was fine.

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:53.800
He was a little surprised, though.

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:55.490
He said to be careful.

00:07:56.840 --> 00:07:59.370
I was surprised, too!

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:00.300
Sana?

00:08:00.300 --> 00:08:02.490
No, "Sa-na-e."

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:05.650
But it does sound similar 
to your name, right?

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:08.540
Sanae...

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:12.510
Sorry.

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:19.650
Well, let's take a little break for now.

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:21.400
Okay.

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:25.350
Do you want to change 
and take a bath first?

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:26.270
No.

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:30.390
My power keeps me from 
getting dirty, so I'm fine.

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:37.200
I hope Sa-chan is eating well.

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:39.660
She won't die so easily.

00:08:42.240 --> 00:08:43.600
Sorry, just a moment.

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:49.240
Harajuku...

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:51.070
Omotesando?

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:53.840
There. How's that?

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:55.550
Not too tight, is it?

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:58.750
No, they aren't too tight, I guess.

00:08:58.750 --> 00:09:00.540
Oh, good.

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:04.020
Sorry that my old clothes are all I have.

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:06.980
I'll do your hair for you.

00:09:07.510 --> 00:09:09.370
How do you usually wear it?

00:09:10.100 --> 00:09:11.320
Usually...

00:09:15.430 --> 00:09:16.510
I don't know.

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:19.320
I can do it myself,

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:22.040
but I don't pay attention 
since I use my power.

00:09:22.760 --> 00:09:24.350
I see...

00:09:24.350 --> 00:09:27.370
Okay, I'll make it cute for you!

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:30.090
There!

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:31.660
All done!

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:36.730
What do you think?

00:09:36.730 --> 00:09:37.960
This is good!

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:40.430
Okay, next...

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:45.850
Eat up.

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:47.700
Wha... Thi... Bu...

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:48.860
What is this?!

00:09:48.860 --> 00:09:50.550
They're pancakes.

00:09:50.550 --> 00:09:52.130
Haven't you had them before?

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:52.980
No!

00:09:55.100 --> 00:09:56.610
I'll cut them for you.

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:01.040
Wow.

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:03.200
Your tummy is growling while you eat!

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:08.920
Are you really his granddaughter?

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:10.200
I sure am.

00:10:10.200 --> 00:10:11.560
You're nothing like him.

00:10:11.560 --> 00:10:14.000
Oh, I'm not?

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:16.890
Then, let's see...

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:20.560
I hate crooked stuff!

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:21.140
Nothing like him.

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:24.720
Hey, Sanae, are there any more?

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:26.620
You finished them already?

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:27.310
Yep.

00:10:27.630 --> 00:10:29.150
Shall I make some more?

00:10:29.150 --> 00:10:30.150
Yeah! Yeah!

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:32.420
Okay, wait just a bit.

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:35.550
How long is "a bit"?

00:10:35.550 --> 00:10:36.660
Well—

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:37.600
I waited a bit.

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:38.710
A bit longer.

00:10:38.710 --> 00:10:39.740
I can't wait.

00:10:43.980 --> 00:10:46.220
Wow! A pancake!

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:48.560
It's so big!

00:10:48.560 --> 00:10:50.520
Sana-chan?

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:53.360
Sana-chan?!

00:11:06.090 --> 00:11:08.810
Making food still doesn't work so well.

00:11:09.130 --> 00:11:10.930
It's too inefficient...

00:11:12.010 --> 00:11:15.720
I guess it's the conservation of energy.

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:19.190
Pancake...

00:11:20.420 --> 00:11:22.010
Don't eat it!

00:11:22.010 --> 00:11:23.990
Shall I make some fresh ones?

00:11:45.840 --> 00:11:48.330
Hey, Sanae! Are they done yet?

00:11:48.330 --> 00:11:50.050
Not yet.

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:52.070
How about now?

00:11:52.070 --> 00:11:53.520
Not yet.

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:55.320
Sanae, are they done now?

00:11:55.320 --> 00:11:56.820
Not yet.

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:57.810
Now?

00:11:57.810 --> 00:11:59.460
No, not yet.

00:12:04.360 --> 00:12:06.980
"Meal... Morning"?

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:10.200
<b>Today's Chores!</b>

00:12:06.980 --> 00:12:09.390
You can read kanji?

00:12:09.390 --> 00:12:10.200
Sure!

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:11.660
<b>Night</b>

00:12:10.650 --> 00:12:11.660
"Night."

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:14.570
Grandpa makes the evening meal.

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:17.310
He can make food?

00:12:17.310 --> 00:12:19.380
Yeah, it's really good.

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:32.210
Sanae, this won't open!

00:12:33.510 --> 00:12:36.980
Maybe you should try pulling 
or sliding it sideways?

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:37.810
Oh!

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:44.590
Flowers!

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:47.860
Grandpa's growing them.

00:12:47.860 --> 00:12:50.160
I water them, too.

00:12:50.570 --> 00:12:52.120
One isn't blooming.

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:54.850
That one blooms at night.

00:12:54.850 --> 00:12:57.050
It's called "queen of the night."

00:12:57.050 --> 00:12:58.590
Oh...

00:13:09.630 --> 00:13:12.430
<i>This feels kind of weird.</i>

00:13:12.790 --> 00:13:14.960
<i>It's cramped and dark,</i>

00:13:14.960 --> 00:13:17.400
<i>and it isn't very clean.</i>

00:13:17.920 --> 00:13:20.270
<i>It's nothing like that other place.</i>

00:13:24.930 --> 00:13:27.880
You really are Zoroku's 
granddaughter, huh?

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:29.380
Hmm?

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:31.450
You're a good person, too.

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:34.770
Why are you nice?

00:13:34.770 --> 00:13:37.500
They were nice, too. But they 
were bad people.

00:13:37.810 --> 00:13:39.270
They?

00:13:40.510 --> 00:13:42.250
At the research facility.

00:13:43.350 --> 00:13:47.080
<i>My memories begin at 
the research facility.</i>

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:52.560
<i>I might have come from somewhere 
else, but I don't remember.</i>

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:55.830
<i>One day, I realized I was there.</i>

00:13:57.580 --> 00:14:00.510
<i>The first thing I knew was hunger.</i>

00:14:04.050 --> 00:14:06.560
<i>They gave me food.</i>

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:14.150
<i>And they put all kinds of 
hard things on my body.</i>

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:16.910
Now, face the other way.

00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:21.010
<i>I didn't understand language,</i>

00:14:21.010 --> 00:14:23.270
<i>but I didn't need it.</i>

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:25.960
<i>I could merge into other 
people's consciousness</i>

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:27.630
<i>and become one with them.</i>

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:33.890
<i>The boundary between other 
people and me was vague.</i>

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:36.270
<i>But one day,</i>

00:14:36.720 --> 00:14:39.220
<i>two people who looked identical appeared.</i>

00:14:40.890 --> 00:14:45.090
<i>So I tried to become one 
with them, as usual.</i>

00:14:47.660 --> 00:14:48.580
You can't.

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:52.780
You and we are different beings.

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:55.370
I am me.

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:57.080
You are you.

00:14:57.890 --> 00:15:00.010
I am me.

00:15:01.810 --> 00:15:06.170
That was when I learned 
what "language" was.

00:15:06.870 --> 00:15:08.890
You are you?

00:15:08.890 --> 00:15:10.010
Yes.

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:12.480
You will also learn to recognize

00:15:12.480 --> 00:15:15.050
the boundary between others and you.

00:15:15.770 --> 00:15:17.650
I am Hinagiri Yonaga.

00:15:17.650 --> 00:15:19.170
The younger twin.

00:15:19.170 --> 00:15:22.060
I'm Hinagiri Asahi, the older.

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:24.220
What's your name?

00:15:24.930 --> 00:15:25.900
I don't know.

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:29.760
Then we'll give you a name.

00:15:29.760 --> 00:15:32.060
We came up with one together.

00:15:32.560 --> 00:15:35.920
The Red Queen loves fish.

00:15:35.920 --> 00:15:37.730
So your name is Sana.

00:15:39.150 --> 00:15:40.340
Sana...

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:45.550
<i>That's how I became Sana.</i>

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:49.060
<i>The twins taught me many things.</i>

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:52.300
<i>Cute, girlish clothes and language.</i>

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:55.870
<i>Counting, lots of songs, 
picture books, and poems.</i>

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:04.110
I was happy every day there.

00:16:09.550 --> 00:16:11.490
But then I saw it.

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:17.270
Far beneath the research facility...

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:21.520
They did something to someone there.

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:23.710
And made them something inhuman.

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:28.310
I was so scared...

00:16:28.310 --> 00:16:30.750
And I ran from the facility!

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:33.630
But the outside world was scary, too...

00:16:34.060 --> 00:16:36.090
I didn't know anything.

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:37.210
I was scared.

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:50.480
You know what?

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:53.500
I really think we are alike.

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:57.300
You and I.

00:16:57.300 --> 00:16:58.520
Our names?

00:17:00.270 --> 00:17:01.440
It's okay.

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:03.700
It'll be okay.

00:17:05.700 --> 00:17:08.370
You're making a mess, Naito-san.

00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:11.380
So what? I was starving!

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:13.970
Don't get the seat dirty.

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:16.960
I'm the one who'll get in trouble 
with the director!

00:17:16.960 --> 00:17:19.800
C'mon, don't be so touchy.

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:22.240
How old are you again, Ichijo-kun?

00:17:22.240 --> 00:17:23.440
I'm 26.

00:17:23.660 --> 00:17:24.690
Wow! Really?

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:26.200
You're so young!

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:28.130
That's sexual harassment, you know.

00:17:28.130 --> 00:17:30.240
Huh? Not at all...

00:17:30.240 --> 00:17:33.280
Okay, ever heard of takenoko-zoku 
dance groups?

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:35.400
I know the meaning of 
the term, but that's all.

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:38.150
Oh, you're a bright one, all right.

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:43.950
Well, at the time, I was still a 
subordinate at the main office.

00:17:44.510 --> 00:17:48.330
Every weekend, they made me work 
security at pedestrian-only zones.

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:53.740
And one time, I saw this grown man 
fighting with some weird kids!

00:17:53.740 --> 00:17:56.080
I thought, "He must be an idiot."

00:17:56.080 --> 00:17:58.990
He was yelling, "I hate crooked stuff!"

00:17:58.990 --> 00:17:59.890
Huh...

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:04.860
And for the thirty years since then, 
we've been buddies, somehow.

00:18:04.860 --> 00:18:07.060
But it's been five years since I saw him.

00:18:07.720 --> 00:18:12.020
This is the first time I've heard 
you talk about a friend.

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:13.780
You two must be very close.

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:15.360
Nah, not at all.

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:19.950
He's a stubborn, old stick in the 
mud. We're polar opposites.

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.060
Oh, look at this...

00:18:21.060 --> 00:18:23.120
His company has a homepage.

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:25.450
It says he's a "flower coordinator."

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:27.880
Sounds to me like you really are close.

00:18:31.320 --> 00:18:33.250
That was delicious...

00:18:35.400 --> 00:18:37.760
Hey, Sanae... Let's go to 
the research facility.

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:38.950
Huh?

00:18:38.950 --> 00:18:41.960
I had lots of good food, 
so I'm all better now!

00:18:41.960 --> 00:18:43.720
This time, I'll crush it.

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:45.880
But...

00:18:45.880 --> 00:18:47.170
Don't worry.

00:18:47.170 --> 00:18:48.920
You can... I know!

00:18:48.920 --> 00:18:51.170
Bring lots of snacks and come with me!

00:18:51.170 --> 00:18:53.950
Oh, by the way, where did Zoroku go?

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:56.190
I think he's working now.

00:18:56.190 --> 00:18:57.920
Working? With flowers?

00:18:57.920 --> 00:18:58.700
I know about that!

00:18:59.190 --> 00:19:00.290
<i>Wow...</i>

00:18:59.560 --> 00:19:01.020
He's a real jerk, leaving me alone!

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:03.940
<i>After all that sleep and a snack, 
you're much more energetic.</i>

00:19:01.020 --> 00:19:03.820
And he's supposed to be my servant!

00:19:04.360 --> 00:19:05.020
What?

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:07.290
Nothing. But...

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:09.550
Just wait for a bit, okay? 
I need to clean up.

00:19:09.550 --> 00:19:11.120
Okay, let's go get him!

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:17.720
We're falling! We're falling!

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:17.270
What the heck?

00:19:17.270 --> 00:19:19.390
I didn't do this on purpose! I swear!

00:19:19.860 --> 00:19:21.170
What's going on?

00:19:20.480 --> 00:19:24.200
Help! Help!

00:19:32.380 --> 00:19:33.910
What the heck?!

00:19:33.910 --> 00:19:35.290
Help!

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:44.250
How cute! Penguins!

00:19:44.250 --> 00:19:44.820
Huh?

00:19:44.820 --> 00:19:47.350
These are penguins. Penguins.

00:19:47.350 --> 00:19:49.980
Wow! It's so cold!

00:19:49.980 --> 00:19:53.640
Is this the South Pole? I've never 
been here before.

00:19:55.900 --> 00:19:57.780
I haven't, either.

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:00.670
Just like me.

00:20:02.630 --> 00:20:04.230
This one's small.

00:20:04.230 --> 00:20:05.980
It's a baby.

00:20:05.980 --> 00:20:07.710
Isn't it cute?

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:09.310
It is cute!

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:11.910
So cute...

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:15.980
<b>Calling... 
Kashimura Sanae</b>

00:20:18.050 --> 00:20:20.940
Boss, which cylinder is it again?

00:20:25.170 --> 00:20:27.340
You're amazing, Sana-chan.

00:20:27.340 --> 00:20:29.120
Can you go anywhere?

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:31.760
Y-Yeah, I can.

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:33.170
Where to next?

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:35.880
Hmm... How about home?

00:20:37.120 --> 00:20:41.200
If we suddenly disappear, 
Grandpa will be surprised.

00:20:41.830 --> 00:20:43.710
Zoroku? Will he be angry?

00:20:43.710 --> 00:20:47.160
No, but he'll be worried.

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:49.220
Really?

00:20:49.520 --> 00:20:51.040
Yep, really.

00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:52.810
Let's go home, okay?

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:55.370
Okay.

00:20:58.520 --> 00:21:00.940
Crap! I forgot!

00:21:01.810 --> 00:21:02.830
Huh?

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:10.190
Pigs! There are pigs in here!

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:13.040
Why are there pigs?

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:15.430
Because I had pork cutlets yesterday?

00:21:23.560 --> 00:21:26.130
Hey, Roku-san, I'm here.

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:29.360
Crying won't tell me anything!

00:21:29.360 --> 00:21:32.050
U-Um, Grandpa, this was...

00:21:33.500 --> 00:21:34.630
Grandpa, I'm saying—

00:21:34.630 --> 00:21:36.480
I'm asking what you're saying!

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:38.480
Right, we're outta here.

00:21:38.880 --> 00:21:40.670
Keep it together, Naito-san.

00:21:40.670 --> 00:21:41.980
This is work.

00:23:15.860 --> 00:23:16.960
So suddenly?

00:23:16.960 --> 00:23:18.720
But I can't just...

00:23:21.240 --> 00:23:22.240
Right.

00:23:22.240 --> 00:23:24.280
I'll make the arrangements at once.

00:23:31.950 --> 00:23:34.410
Call Minnie C.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
Next Episode 
Cards

00:23:36.320 --> 00:23:37.380
Cards.
